  "body": "## Issue\nCloses #192\nClaim: cloud/lot-101-sonnet\nLOT-101\nAuthor model: Sonnet 5.5\n\n## What and why\nProblem: SwiftHFR keeps one draft per topic; legacy at `87fe0d1c` also keeps up to 3 archived drafts per topic and a \"Brouillons\" picker in the composer (`AnswerView.swift:103-244, 693-760, 783-796, 1855-2001`).\n\nChange (reply composer only):\n- `HFRStorage`: `DraftContext.archivedReply(topic:id:source:)` + `DraftStore.archiveReply / archivedReplies / discardArchivedReply / discardArchivedReplies` (≤ 3 per topic and account, newest first, same text replaces itself, blank never archived; one `mutate` per change). Same file, TTL, bound and logout as every draft.\n- App: `ReplyComposerModel+ArchivedDrafts` (set aside and clear, use, delete, \"Vider\", picked draft removed once HFR confirms the reply), `ArchivedDraftsView` (picker sheet), \"Brouillons\" toolbar button, `ArchivedDraftsFormat` (source, date, preview labels).\n- Spec `docs/lots/LOT-101-archived-drafts.md` completed (legacy counterpart, behaviour, 8 intentional differences). Legacy archives are not imported (ADR 0013 Amendment 3).\n\nNot wider: no quote/replace archiving (LOT-086 merges quotes), no undo history, no `forumReply` source (no producer in SwiftHFR).\n\n## How it was verified\n- Engine, run on Linux: `swift test --package-path Packages/HFRKit --filter ArchivedRepliesTests|DraftStoreTests` → 35 passed. Shown to fail without the change: limit 3→4 fails 3 tests; no same-text replacement fails `theSameTextAgainReplacesItInsteadOfDoubling`.\n- App tests (`ArchivedDraftsTests`, `ArchivedDraftsFormatTests`) written with compiler rigour, **not run** (no Xcode in the cloud): CI on a Mac is the arbiter.\n- No HFR request, no fixture, no capture.\n- Mac checks (owed): filled \"Brouillons\" button, sheet detents with the keyboard, focus back on the editor after a pick, VoiceOver on a row, date labels in the device locale.\n\n### Ledger\n```gap-edit\nGAP-093\nLegacy ref: — @ `2440d79`; `AnswerView.swift:103-272, 783-796, 1855-2001` @ `87fe0d1c`\nSwiftHFR final: Archived drafts per topic (≤ 3 per account, kept 30 days like drafts) and their picker; a quote merges into the draft so it archives nothing (LOT-101).\nGap: ported with changes\n```\n\n## Checklist (AGENTS.md §9)\n- [x] Module boundaries respected (no sibling imports in HFRKit, no UI framework in HFRKit)\n- [x] Tests added/updated\n- [x] No secrets; fixtures anonymized (none)\n- [x] Docs updated (lot spec); after the merge the issue is closed by hand with `Done in #PR (merged as <sha>)`\n- [ ] Author model: Sonnet 5.5 / Reviewer model: Opus (pending)\n- [x] Ledger section above, label `ledger`\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_014QH2CGfiYXpuRJZ7DpTXQY)_",
