   "body": "**Adversarial review (Opus 5.5, independent of the author): APPROVE** — head 476d33b64bb48677e1586461201ad4eb8f8eca34\n\n1. **Low**, `ArchivedDraftsTests.swift:159` (`aPendingAutosaveNeverBringsBackTheTextSetAside`): likely stays green without `settleAutosave()` in `archiveAndClear`, since `persist()` reads `text`, already empty. Not blocking, the behaviour is correct. Fix: rename, or check `CountingDraftPersistence.saves`.\n\nEarlier findings 1-3 and 5 fixed; 4 partly (see above); the `private(set)` nit declined (extension in another file, new test needs the setter).\n\n**Checked**: compile check of the delta by reading (no cross-file write to a private member remains); new tests call existing APIs; without the `isMovingDrafts` guards `nothingIsDeletedFromTheArchiveWhileAMoveRuns` fails; `HH:mm` follows legacy `AnswerView.swift:1989` @ 87fe0d1c; no line over 140.\n\nNot built or run (Linux): CI on a Mac is the arbiter.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
